    "http": "# v1 API — Generated from OpenAPI spec\n\n@host = http://localhost/api\n@token = Bearer {{token}}\n\n### List items\nReturns paginated list\nGET {{host}}/v1/item/list?token=&page=&perPage=\n\n### Show item\nReturns single item by ID\nGET {{host}}/v1/item/show?token=&id=\n\n### Create item\nCreates a new item\nPOST {{host}}/v1/item/create\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\ntoken=&name=&description=\n\n### Update item\nUpdates an existing item\nPOST {{host}}/v1/item/update\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\ntoken=&id=&name=\n\n### Delete item\nDeletes an item\nPOST {{host}}/v1/item/remove\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\ntoken=&id=\n\n### Ping\nHealth check endpoint.\nGET {{host}}/v1/open/ping\n",
    "markdown": "# Test API v1 (v1)\n\nTest API description\n\n**Base URL:** `http://localhost/api`\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [item](#item)\n- [open](#open)\n\n## item\n\n### List items\nReturns paginated list\n\n`GET /v1/item/list`\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n| Name | Type | Required | Description |\n|------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `token` | string | Yes | Auth token |\n| `page` | integer | No | Page number |\n| `perPage` | integer | No | Items per page |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n\n### Show item\nReturns single item by ID\n\n`GET /v1/item/show`\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n| Name | Type | Required | Description |\n|------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `token` | string | Yes | Auth token |\n| `id` | integer | Yes | Item ID |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n\n### Create item\nCreates a new item\n\n`POST /v1/item/create`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `token` | string | Yes | Auth token |\n| `name` | string | Yes | Item name |\n| `description` | string | No | Item description |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n\n### Update item\nUpdates an existing item\n\n`POST /v1/item/update`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `token` | string | Yes | Auth token |\n| `id` | integer | Yes | Item ID |\n| `name` | string | Yes | Item name |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n\n### Delete item\nDeletes an item\n\n`POST /v1/item/remove`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `token` | string | Yes | Auth token |\n| `id` | integer | Yes | Item ID |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n\n## open\n\n### Ping\nHealth check endpoint.\n\n`GET /v1/open/ping`\n\nDetails: ItemController::list()\nDocs: status page (https://example.test/health)\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n",
    "curl": "#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Test API v1 (v1) — cURL examples\n# Auto-generated from OpenAPI spec. Do not edit manually.\n\nBASE_URL=\"http://localhost/api\"\nTOKEN=\"${API_TOKEN:-}\"\n\n# List items\nReturns paginated list\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/item/list?token=&page=&perPage=\"\n\n# Show item\nReturns single item by ID\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/item/show?token=&id=\"\n\n# Create item\nCreates a new item\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -d \"token=\" \\\n  -d \"name=\" \\\n  -d \"description=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/item/create\"\n\n# Update item\nUpdates an existing item\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -d \"token=\" \\\n  -d \"id=\" \\\n  -d \"name=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/item/update\"\n\n# Delete item\nDeletes an item\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -d \"token=\" \\\n  -d \"id=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/item/remove\"\n\n# Ping\nHealth check endpoint.\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/open/ping\"\n",
